{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your loadout, choose your art brushes, and blast your way to a masterpiece! Pew-casso is a top-down action-roguelite shooter where you defeat rounds of enemies to create a piece of art. The longer you last, the more complex your unique piece of art will become. Level up to unlock new abilities and art brushes. Customize your loadout to match your play style. Utilize a wide range of artistic options to make each piece truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MODES:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Onslaught: A combat-only mode with increased enemy numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objectives: Battle enemies while completing a variety of objectives.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel Dispatch: Deliver fuel to two transports to help them reach their docks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the point: A moving king of the hill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Megaton: Power up a bomb to activate a devastating blast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggernaut: Charge up cannons to take down the juggernaut and its weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overload: Overload the machine, filling the arena with path-blocking boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More to follow, including boss fights...</i></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>COMBAT:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique enemy types with different strengths and weaknesses to adjust to on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-depth combat and bullet time system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable loadout: Choose from 2 active and 1 passive ability to customize your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A current total of 10 abilities to unlock, with more to come.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ART:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable paint brushes: Choose between 3 levels of art brushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of backgrounds, borders, and overlays to apply the finishing touches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A current total of 18 brushes to unlock, with more to come.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Customizable color palettes in development)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 levels of unlockables to modify and customize your combat loadout and artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MUSIC:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different playlists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring tracks and original music from Light Diver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn off the music to play your own tunes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the community and help shape the future of Pew-casso!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008800?t=1758139841","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/aa51d6fc3d3f62d00070bafca6556dc1dfffafa9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758139841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/2ca32aecf82cb115bb1b7307673e83b9540b3d26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758139841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/2ca32aecf82cb115bb1b7307673e83b9540b3d26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758139841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficu